/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 74 771.5 Tm (- Investigate every discrepancy above tolerance and record the cause.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 74 755.5 Tm (- Raise count tasks automatically after short picks and zero-stock confirmations.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 74 739.5 Tm (- Train counters and keep turnover in the counting team low.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 713.0 Tm (Further research) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 697.5 Tm (We recommend a controlled multi-site trial comparing uniform and ABC schedules, and further) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 683.5 Tm (work on whether handheld prompts for root-cause entry improve the quality of investigation. A) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 669.5 Tm (follow-up review should be completed by October 2027.) Tj
